**8.3 The function's end and the common tail it includes -- every exit of the arm: `break` -> the tail (which executes
the translated instruction), or `goto bad` -> `bad:`** (`src/cpus/cpu_ppc_instr.c`, then `src/cpus/cpu_dyntrans.c` under
`#ifdef DYNTRANS_TO_BE_TRANSLATED_TAIL`):
