~~~~
1916| #  ------------------------------------------------------------ m88kbuserrregs (#570)
1917| #  A CLAIMED, REFUSED, UNSUPPRESSED m88k device access that passes the running-transition check (the device returns 0 with
1918| #  the cpu still running; NO_EXCEPTIONS callers excluded) now records its bus error in the faulting side's CMMU WHEN THE
1919| #  SELECTED CMMU EXISTS (memory_rw.c's refused-device arm: PFSR = BERROR << 16, PFAR = the physical address), and
