1921| #  (regress/artifacts/m88kbuserrregs/witness_20261023/, 16/24 on HEAD) is NOT run here; this is its detector: 31 rows, the
1922| #  witness's 24 plus the instruction label (ifetch x4), a NO_EXCEPTIONS caller (dbg noexc) and a CMMU-less cpu (null surv,
1923| #  null route; mvme187 -n 2).  Needs only the binary: mvme187 -M 64 [-n 2] and luna-88k, each with a 4-byte dummy image at
1924| #  0x10000 -- no PROM, no rig image.  Kill table: regress/artifacts/m88kbuserrregs/table1_20261023/ (SCORES.txt).  Like
