* **Confirmed N/A (`READ`)**: Every predicate in the diff and shared tail (`main_opcode`, `iword & 3`, `imm == 0`, `ra == 0`, `update`, `fp`) is an exact equality or boolean test; there are no relational comparisons (`<`, `<=`, `>`, `>=`) against a numeric bound.

