2723: **R1 -- THE FLOOR** -- lines 1328-1333, VERBATIM:
2724: ~~~~
2725: 1328| > **THE FLOOR.** A detector is VACUOUS �?" replace it IN-ROUND �?" unless it (a) fails on the
2726: 1329| > pre-fix build, (b) fails on a **VERBATIM REINSTATEMENT of the removed defect at EVERY fixed
2727: 1330| > site**, and (c) fails on a **NULL MEDIUM** -- a product medium carrying none of the behaviour under
2728: 1331| > test (the clause-(c) block below says what that is per instrument kind). Below the floor, the
2729: 1332| > round's own claim to have "shipped a detector with the fix" is a WRONG RECORD, which the
2730: 1333| > stopping rule already fixes in-round.
2731: ~~~~
