### (b) Gate home

**Gate 13 (`gate_ppc.sh`)** is correct - it is the PowerPC gate and already runs three PPC probes on `bareppc` before `need_file NetBSD`.  
**Placement:** after the three existing register-to-register probes (`ppc_rlwimi_probe.py`, `ppc_rldimi_probe.py`, `ppc_rldicl_probe.py`) but before the `need_file "$IMAGES/netbsd401-macppc-GENERIC"` line.  
